description 5 has the label "Article 58 on the responsibilities of Member States, Annex IV on key requirements for the Member State’s management, control and audit systems and Annex XVI on SCF2027,".

description 5 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/0/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_0/FINAL/eng/anx_4/art_58".

