member states shall systems procedures in place to ensure is identified by "http://example.org/standard/member-states-shall-have-systems-and-procedures-in-place-to-ensure-that-all-supporting-documents-necessary-for-the-audit-trail-related-to-a-measure-supported-by-the-fund-are-kept-at-the-appropriate-level-for-a-10-year-period-from-31-december-of-the-year-in-which-the-last-payment-by-the-commission-to-the-member-state-is-made-where-a-redress-procedure-has-been-initiated-an-appeal-has-been-lodged-or-where-court-proceedings-have-begun-the-supporting-documents-shall-be-kept-until-those-procedures-or-any-subsequent-recovery-procedures-are-terminated".

member states shall systems procedures in place to ensure is a standard.

member states shall systems procedures in place to ensure has the title "Member States shall have systems and procedures in place to ensure that all supporting documents necessary for the audit trail related to a measure supported by the Fund are kept at the appropriate level for a 10-year period from 31 December of the year in which the last payment by the Commission to the Member State is made; where a redress procedure has been initiated, an appeal has been lodged or where court proceedings have begun, the supporting documents shall be kept until those procedures or any subsequent recovery procedures are terminated;".


