item the commission shall publish this data subject to exceptions is a standard.

item the commission shall publish this data subject to exceptions has the title "The Commission shall publish this data, subject to exceptions provided for by the regulation, on a centralised website with the share of Union contribution referred to in the [Performance regulation]. Information on name and surname, in case of a natural person, or name, in case of a legal entity, shall not be published, if the amount received by them in one year is equal to or less than EUR 2500.".


